  ContextEn: The port is the last escape route. The zombies have captured him.
  ContextTr: "Liman son ka\xE7\u0131\u015F yoludur. Zombiler onu ele ge\xE7irdi."
  ObjectiveRu: "\u0417\u0430\u0447\u0438\u0441\u0442\u0438\u0442\u0435 \u043F\u043E\u0440\u0442
